Date: Thu, 6 Aug 2026 12:36:37 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 03/21] spi: add sunxi SPIF controller support

Upstream-Status: Pending

Keep the controller clocks gated while it is idle. Enable them for each
SPI memory request, then mask and drain interrupts and synchronize the IRQ
before disabling the clocks. Briefly enable the clocks for sampling updates
which access controller registers as well.
---
 drivers/spi/Kconfig          |   9 +
 drivers/spi/Makefile         |   1 +
 drivers/spi/spi-sunxi-spif.c | 1015 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 1025 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 drivers/spi/spi-sunxi-spif.c

